# Integrations: signed webhooks (Zapier, Make, n8n), Slack, Calendly / Cal.com, verification, forms.
# Admin token for /integrations; secrets are write-only (only a hint comes back).

@token = PASTE-AN-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@webhookId = PASTE-A-WEBHOOK-ID
@connectionId = PASTE-A-CONNECTION-ID
@contactId = PASTE-A-CONTACT-ID
@formKey = PASTE-A-FORM-PUBLIC-KEY

### Everything on the Integrations page
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Subscribe a Zapier catch hook to new quote requests and won deals (the secret is shown once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zapier: new quote requests",
  "url": "https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/123/abc/",
  "event_types": ["lead.created", "deal.won"]
}

### Send a signed ping now
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/webhooks/{{webhookId}}/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delivery log (retry a dead one with POST /integrations/deliveries/{id}/retry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrations/deliveries?target_id={{webhookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Slack alerts in a channel
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "slack",
  "name": "#pricing",
  "secret": "https://hooks.slack.com/services/T000/B000/XXXX",
  "config": {"alerts": ["positive_reply", "new_lead", "deal_won", "meeting_booked"]}
}

### Test the Slack channel
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/connections/{{connectionId}}/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calendly: the response's webhook_url goes into the Calendly webhook subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "calendly",
  "name": "Sales calendar",
  "secret": "a-signing-key-of-your-choice",
  "config": {"office_id": null}
}

### Verify one contact's address (mock rules until MillionVerifier is connected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}/verify-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify up to 200 contacts never verified
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts/verify-emails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit": 200}

### A website quote form (the response carries the embed HTML)
POST {{baseUrl}}/forms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Request a quote",
  "tag": "website-quote",
  "fields": ["first_name", "last_name", "company", "origin", "destination", "mode", "message"]
}

### What the website sends (public, no token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/forms/{{formKey}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=buyer%40shipper.example&first_name=Sam&origin=Toronto&destination=Istanbul&mode=air&website=
